		IFS-related free software Directory 

	----------------------------------------------------

This directory contains IFS-based softwares developed outside of ICOT
and other useful softwares. 
For detailed information, please refer to README(.j) file of each
directory. 

* Directories
cuprolog/
	Macintosh and MS-DOS version of cu-Prolog developed by 
	Prof. Hidetosi Sirai of Chukyo University.

m-qxt/
	Macintosh version of micro-Quixote developed by
	Yukihiro Morita of Oki Electric Industry Co. Ltd.

contest/
       Sample proguram used by KLIC PROGRAMING CONTEST

h8itaku/
        This directory is created temporaly.

h9itaku/
        This directory is created temporaly.

	----------------------------------------------------	

Inquiries on IFS are welcome. Please contact the following e-mail 
addresses for information :

	On ICOT Free Software:		ifs@icot.or.jp
	On Software related to IFS:	irpr@icot.or.jp
        On KLIC PROGRAMING CONTEST:     klic-contest@icot.or.jp
